<xliff xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:2.0" xmlns:swi18n="https://step-wise.com/ns/i18n" version="2.1" srcLang="en" trgLang="nl">
	<file id="catalog">
		<unit id="intro">
			<segment>
				<source>People learn best by doing. That's why Step-Wise is focused around (1) you <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">practicing</pc>, and (2) on <pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">coaching</pc> you to practice on your level.</source>
				<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="5998070a633d970c" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="ffc1729663679c98">De beste manier om iets te leren is door het te doen. Daarom richt Step-Wise zich op (1) jou helpen met <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">oefenen</pc>, en (2) jou <pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">coachen</pc> om te oefenen op jouw niveau.</target>
			</segment>
		</unit>
		<group id="practice">
			<unit id="head">
				<segment>
					<source>Practice</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="7c0e2586199aed33" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Oefenen</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="intro">
				<segment>
					<source>When starting to practice, it helps to know the <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">structure</pc> behind Step-Wise.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="d7cf5650e3680413" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="4c5edc7f50011465">Als je begint met oefenen, helpt het om de <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">structuur</pc> achter Step-Wise te kennen.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<group id="skills">
				<unit id="head">
					<segment>
						<source>Focused around skills</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="f38795b5d2c6903c" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Opgebouwd rond vaardigheden</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
				<unit id="par1">
					<segment>
						<source>In Step-Wise, all educational content is split up into small <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">skills</pc>: something that you can actually do. Every skill has roughly 2-10 minutes worth of information. We'll tell you exactly how it works, from an intuitive point of view, and which steps you need to take to apply said skill.</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="39dae97b8f48e1cd" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="4c5edc7f50011465">In Step-Wise is al het lesmateriaal opgesplitst in kleine <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">vaardigheden</pc>: iets dat je daadwerkelijk kan doen. Elke vaardigheid heeft grofweg 2-10 minuten aan informatie. We vertellen je precies hoe het werkt, vanuit een intuïtief oogpunt, en welke stappen je moet uitvoeren om de vaardigheid toe te passen.</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
				<group id="theoryImage">
					<unit id="theory">
						<segment>
							<source>Theory</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="f271c089afcf5263" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Theorie</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="practice">
						<segment>
							<source>Practice</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="7c0e2586199aed33" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Oefenen</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="background">
						<segment>
							<source>Background</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="52df82c15e8303c8" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Achtergrondinfo</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="head1">
						<segment>
							<source>How it works</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="ed4a5d49cb19da1b" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Hoe het werkt</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="head2">
						<segment>
							<source>The steps to take</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="356acb0c1e3935fc" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">De stappen</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
				</group>
			</group>
			<group id="feedback">
				<unit id="head">
					<segment>
						<source>Exercises give specific feedback</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="ed8e1cb0e511b159" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Oefenopgaven geven gerichte feedback</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
				<unit id="par1">
					<segment>
						<source>Everyone makes small mistakes every now and then. When you do, we have you covered. You'll get <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">specific feedback</pc> on where the error might be. This teaches you to find your own mistakes, so that you won't make them anymore in the future.</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="b196738652ff64e8" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="4c5edc7f50011465">Iedereen maakt wel eens een foutje. Als dat gebeurt, dan heb je ondersteuning. Je krijgt <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">gerichte feedback</pc> op waar de fout kan liggen. Dit leert je om je eigen fouten te vinden, zodat je ze in de toekomst niet nogmaals maakt.</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
				<group id="practiceImage">
					<unit id="theory">
						<segment>
							<source>Theory</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="f271c089afcf5263" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Theorie</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="practice">
						<segment>
							<source>Practice</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="7c0e2586199aed33" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Oefenen</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="background">
						<segment>
							<source>Background</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="52df82c15e8303c8" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Achtergrondinfo</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
