						<segment>
							<source>Check the carry.</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="55ccdc614ebce662" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Controleer het overdragen.</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="stepWiseButton">
						<segment>
							<source>Solve this Step-Wise</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="c092faafdcbd5cb4" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Los stapsgewijs op</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="submitButton">
						<segment>
							<source>Submit and check</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="7d168d9513e3eac7" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Controleer</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
				</group>
			</group>
			<group id="steps">
				<unit id="head">
					<segment>
						<source>Split up exercises into steps</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="dd9ba4804271d061" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Opgaven in stappen opsplitsen</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
				<unit id="par1">
					<segment>
						<source>If you've got no idea on how to solve an exercise, then you can always <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">split it up into steps</pc>. Each step is a skill that you've practiced before, ensuring that you'll reach the final result. On top of that, each step always has clear and intuitive solutions.</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="f6a4ee14b190ee44" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="4c5edc7f50011465">Als je geen idee hebt hoe je een oefenopgave aan moet pakken, dan kun je hem altijd <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">in stappen opsplitsen</pc>. Elke stap is een vaardigheid die je eerder al geoefend hebt, waardoor je gegarandeerd tot het eindresultaat weet te komen. Daarnaast heeft elke stap altijd duidelijke en intuïtief uitgelegde oplossingen.</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
				<group id="practiceImage">
					<unit id="theory">
						<segment>
							<source>Theory</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="f271c089afcf5263" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Theorie</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="practice">
						<segment>
							<source>Practice</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="7c0e2586199aed33" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Oefenen</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="background">
						<segment>
							<source>Background</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="52df82c15e8303c8" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Achtergrondinfo</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="exercise">
						<segment>
							<source>Calculate <ph id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/>.</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="5c8ccd0b83329f68" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="8c52ffd8f6d33b16">Bereken <ph id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/>.</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="step1">
						<segment>
							<source>Step 1</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="182748ee2ed8a7b7" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Stap 1</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="giveUpButton">
						<segment>
							<source>I give up this step</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="843e19b84587b131" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Ik geef deze stap op</target>
						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="submitButton">
						<segment>
							<source>Submit and check</source>
							<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="7d168d9513e3eac7" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Controleer</target>
